@startuml
title EcoRefill — Use case diagram
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #EAF7F1
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #23765C
actor Customer
actor "Device owner" as Owner
rectangle "EcoRefill system\nApp • kiosk • Pi services • cloud storage • machine hardware" {
  usecase "Sign in / sign out" as Login
  usecase "Manage own profile" as Profile
  usecase "Register customer account" as RegisterCustomer
  usecase "View EcoPoint balance" as Balance
  usecase "Recycle bottles and cans" as Recycle
  usecase "Claim recycling reward by QR" as Claim
  usecase "Request water refill by QR" as Refill
  usecase "Buy EcoPoints via GCash" as Buy
  usecase "Check purchase status" as PurchaseStatus
  usecase "View own transaction history" as History
  usecase "Register owner and link available machine" as RegisterOwner
  usecase "Monitor machine and recycling statistics" as Monitor
  usecase "View scan photos and rejection details" as Photos
  usecase "View machine alerts" as Alerts
  usecase "Approve or reject point purchases" as Review
  usecase "Configure GCash receiving account" as GCashSettings
  usecase "Update machine details and location" as Location
  usecase "View machine transactions and owner points" as OwnerHistory
}
Customer -- Login
Owner -- Login
Customer -- Profile
Owner -- Profile
Customer -- RegisterCustomer
Customer -- Balance
Customer -- Recycle
Customer -- Claim
Customer -- Refill
Customer -- Buy
Customer -- PurchaseStatus
Customer -- History
Owner -- RegisterOwner
Owner -- Monitor
Owner -- Photos
Owner -- Alerts
Owner -- Review
Owner -- GCashSettings
Owner -- Location
Owner -- OwnerHistory
note bottom of Buy
  Available from a scanned refill session.
  Customer pays outside EcoRefill in GCash.
  Only owner approval transfers EcoPoints.
end note
note bottom of Monitor
  Sensor readings and alerts are displayed
  when supplied by the installation.
end note
legend bottom
  Actors are human roles; lines show participation, not sequence.
  Recycling is available without login. Account operations require authentication.
  Machine hardware and Firebase are within this whole-system boundary.
  GCash has no automatic API integration in the current implementation.
endlegend
@enduml
